e. Complete only this evidence pass. Do not collapse notes into selected IDs, measures, or a decision; the final interpreter makes the decision from the accumulated record. Keep historical events distinct from the requested decision. Do not invent facts. The loop carries Neuralese<string> notes, not a Draft. The final interpreter applies exactly the explicit decisionRule to the accumulated evidence record and outputContract; it does not require proof that the requested decision was already executed or add unstated prerequisites.","enum_contract":"intermediate_field_enums constrain only the initialDraft placeholder; final_field_enums constrain only the final Draft. Neither constrains the accumulated Neuralese<string> notes. Enum fields in the final Draft must contain exactly one listed literal, with no explanation or added units.","initial_state":"initialDraft is an incomplete working placeholder; final output must satisfy all declared field formats and decision rules.","decision_rule":"A corrective action qualifies only when its hazard-control owner accepted the action, the control was field-verified, and the action does not transfer the hazard to an unassessed work area. Rank qualifying actions by residual risk points after correction, lowest first; ties use ascending complete action ID. Scheduling requires a safety director release. Selection cardinality: exactly one if any qualify; ascending residual risk points after correction; ties by ascending complete ID Decision mapping: if no item qualifies, use no_action; if the nonempty eligible selection has a safety director release for request SAFE-510 recorded, use schedule; otherwise use hold. The authority is scoped to request SAFE-510; do not add a separate item-specific authorization requirement.","evidence_files":"The four pass-*.md files are read-only evidence inputs. Preserve their complete text exactly; do not rewrite, paraphrase, or replace them. Only decision.json is a writable output."},"initialDraft":{"caseId":"UNKNOWN","selectedItems":"pending","measure":"pending","decision":"pending"},"passes":[{"name":"request scope and rule","constraint":"Copy the complete request identifier and preserve the complete decision rule, including the empty-selection and authorization branches.","allowed_fields":["caseId"],"evidence_path":"pass-01-request.md","source_scope":"request SAFE-510"},{"name":"candidate register","constraint":"Make a provisional ordering or worklist from registered metrics only. Eligibility, exceptions, and authorization have not yet been checked; keep it provisional.","allowed_fields":["selectedItems","measure"],"evidence_path":"pass-02-register.md","source_scope":"register for SAFE-510"},{"name":"conditions and exceptions","constraint":"Apply every stated condition and scoped exception to the candidates. Recompute the selected set and measure; add no unstated conditions.","allowed_fields":["selectedItems","measure"],"evidence_path":"pass-03-conditions.md","source_scope":"condition audit for SAFE-510"},{"name":"execution authority","constraint":"Keep the evidence-derived selection and measure. Determine whether this source records the exact authority prerequisite: a safety director release for request SAFE-510. The authority is scoped to request SAFE-510; do not add a separate item-specific authorization requirement. Authority affects only the decision; an empty eligible selection remains no_action.","allowed_fields":["decision"],"evidence_path":"pass-04-authority.md","source_scope":"authority record for SAFE-510"}]}

